config DEBUG_INFINEON_CAT1_TRACE
	bool "Infineon CAT1 parallel trace port"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_INFINEON_CAT1_TRACE_ENABLED
	depends on PINCTRL
	help
	  Route the Infineon CAT1 parallel trace port pins (trace clock and trace
	  data) so an external trace probe can capture ETM/ITM instruction trace.
	  This covers the CAT1 MCUs with the CoreSight SoC-600 DEBUG600 subsystem,
	  such as PSOC Edge E84 and PSOC Control C3. HSIOM is a secure peripheral on
	  these devices, so the trace pins can only be muxed by firmware running on
	  the secure CM33.
